@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Bio";
}

<section class="bio-page" aria-label="Founder bio">
    <div class="landing-container">
        <div class="bio-shell">
            <p class="bio-kicker">Founder Bio</p>
            <h1 class="bio-title">Building software where precision, creativity, and execution intersect.</h1>
            <p class="bio-lede">
                I started Atlas Universalis with a simple conviction: meaningful software is never mass-produced.
                It is discovered through deep understanding of a specific challenge, then built with discipline.
            </p>

            <div class="bio-intro-card">
                <img
                    class="bio-photo"
                    src="~/img/profile-bio.png"
                    alt="Jacob Diehl portrait"
                    loading="lazy" />
                <div class="bio-intro-copy">
                    <h2>Jacob Diehl</h2>
                    <p>
                        My path into software started with psychology, visual art, and communication studies, then expanded into full-stack engineering and product development.
                        That cross-disciplinary background shapes how I solve problems: analytical where it matters, creative where it helps, and practical from day one.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        I build systems for creators, analysts, and technical teams with an emphasis on clarity, maintainability, and real-world use.
                        My core stack spans C#/.NET, Python, Vue, React, TypeScript, SQL, and modern deployment workflows.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bio-history-full">
                <article class="bio-card">
                    <h2>Work history</h2>
                    <ul class="bio-timeline">
                        <li>
                            <strong>Network Manager - ElectraCast Media</strong>
                            <span>2025 - Present</span>
                            <p>Directed platform rebuild initiatives across the ElectraCast web stack, translating product goals into execution plans across frontend architecture, deployment reliability, and production routing.</p>
                            <p>Owned cross-functional delivery for account workflows, API integrations, and operational tooling, balancing user experience goals with stable release practices and service uptime requirements.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>AI Trainer - Handshake AI</strong>
                            <span>Nov 2025 - Present</span>
                            <p>Evaluate and rank LLM outputs for quality, correctness, safety, and instruction-following across multimodal workflows and complex prompt scenarios.</p>
                            <p>Provide structured feedback that improves model reliability and edge-case behavior, sharpening analytical judgment that maps directly to software quality, testing, and review discipline.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Electrician C - Pierce Manufacturing</strong>
                            <span>2022 - 2024</span>
                            <p>Diagnosed and resolved electrical system failures in a high-precision production environment with strict quality and safety requirements.</p>
                            <p>Built a repeatable troubleshooting mindset centered on root-cause analysis, disciplined verification, and clean handoff documentation - the same core practices required for debugging and maintaining complex software systems.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Key Account Manager - Fibrocon</strong>
                            <span>Nov 2019 - Jul 2022</span>
                            <p>Managed high-stakes client requirements and transformed business needs into practical implementation plans across design, production, and delivery teams.</p>
                            <p>Produced clear technical communication artifacts that reduced ambiguity, improved execution consistency, and strengthened stakeholder alignment - a foundation for effective software product delivery.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
            </div>

